function filterVisitors(){const s=state(),q=($('#visitorSearch')?.value||'').toLowerCase(),t=$('#visitorType')?.value||'',st=$('#visitorStatus')?.value||'';const rows=s.visitors.filter(v=>(!q||`${v.name} ${v.id} ${v.host} ${v.purpose}`.toLowerCase().includes(q))&&(!t||v.type===t)&&(!st||v.status===st));$('#visitorRows').innerHTML=visitorTable(rows)}
function filterIncidents(){const s=state(),q=($('#incidentSearch')?.value||'').toLowerCase(),c=$('#incidentCat')?.value||'',st=$('#incidentStatus')?.value||'',p=$('#incidentPriority')?.value||'';const rows=s.incidents.filter(i=>(!q||`${i.id} ${i.location} ${i.officer} ${i.description} ${i.learner}`.toLowerCase().includes(q))&&(!c||i.category===c)&&(!st||i.status===st)&&(!p||i.priority===p));$('#incidentRows').innerHTML=incidentTable(rows)}
function filterNotifications(){const s=state(),q=($('#notificationSearch')?.value||'').toLowerCase(),c=$('#notificationCat')?.value||'',p=$('#notificationPriority')?.value||'',st=$('#notificationStatus')?.value||'';const rows=s.notifications.filter(n=>(!q||`${n.id} ${n.title} ${n.description}`.toLowerCase().includes(q))&&(!c||n.category===c)&&(!p||n.priority===p)&&(!st||(st==='Read'?n.read:!n.read)));$('#notificationRows').innerHTML=notificationTable(rows)}
function filterLearners(){const s=state(),q=($('#learnerSearch')?.value||'').toLowerCase();$('#learnerRows').innerHTML=learnerTable(s.learners.filter(x=>`${x.id} ${x.name} ${x.grade} ${x.class} ${x.parent}`.toLowerCase().includes(q)),true)}
function openAction(type){let title='',body='',saveText='Save';const s=state();if(type==='register'){title='Register Visitor';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Full name</label><input class="input" id="mName"></div><div class="field"><label>Visitor type</label><select class="select" id="mType"><option>Parent</option><option>Visitor</option><option>Service Provider</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Person visiting</label><input class="input" id="mHost"></div><div class="field"><label>Purpose</label><input class="input" id="mPurpose"></div></div>`}else if(type==='incident'){title='Report Incident';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Category</label><select class="select" id="mCat"><option>Safety</option><option>Medical</option><option>Security</option><option>Behaviour</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Priority</label><select class="select" id="mPriority"><option>Low</option><option>Medium</option><option>High</option><option>Critical</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Location</label><input class="input" id="mLocation"></div><div class="field"><label>Learner involved</label><input class="input" id="mLearner" placeholder="Optional"></div><div class="field full"><label>Description</label><textarea class="textarea" id="mDesc" rows="4"></textarea></div></div>`}else if(type==='emergency'){title='Emergency Alert';saveText='Send emergency alert';body=`<div class="field"><label>Alert title</label><input class="input" id="mAlertTitle"></div><div class="field mt"><label>Description</label><textarea class="textarea" id="mAlertDesc" rows="4"></textarea></div>`}else if(type==='scan'){title='Gate QR Scanner';saveText='Check visitor';body=`<div class="empty"><div style="font-size:60px;color:var(--primary)">⌗</div><b>Ready to scan</b><p>Enter a visitor pass ID to simulate a checkpoint scan.</p><input class="input" id="scanId" placeholder="VIS-1042"></div>`}else if(type==='learner'){title='Register Learner';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Learner name</label><input class="input" id="mLearnerName"></div><div class="field"><label>Grade</label><input class="input" id="mGrade" placeholder="Grade 5"></div><div class="field"><label>Class</label><input class="input" id="mClass" placeholder="5A"></div><div class="field"><label>Parent / Guardian</label><input class="input" id="mParent"></div><div class="field"><label>Teacher</label><input class="input" id="mTeacher"></div></div>`}else if(type==='sick'){title='Submit Sick Notice';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Learner / person</label><input class="input" id="mSickPerson"></div><div class="field"><label>Submitted by</label><input class="input" id="mSickBy"></div><div class="field full"><label>Reason</label><textarea class="textarea" id="mSickReason" rows="3"></textarea></div></div>`}else if(type==='announcement'){title='New Announcement';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Title</label><input class="input" id="mAnnTitle"></div><div class="field"><label>Audience</label><input class="input" id="mAnnAudience" placeholder="All learners and staff"></div><div class="field full"><label>Message</label><textarea class="textarea" id="mAnnBody" rows="4"></textarea></div></div>`}else if(type==='appointment'){title='New Appointment';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Date</label><input class="input" id="mApDate" type="date"></div><div class="field"><label>Time</label><input class="input" id="mApTime" type="time"></div><div class="field"><label>Person</label><input class="input" id="mApPerson"></div><div class="field"><label>Purpose</label><input class="input" id="mApPurpose"></div><div class="field"><label>Staff member</label><input class="input" id="mApStaff"></div></div>`}else if(type==='score'){title='Add Test Score';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Learner</label><input class="input" id="mScoreLearner"></div><div class="field"><label>Subject</label><input class="input" id="mScoreSubject"></div><div class="field"><label>Assessment</label><input class="input" id="mScoreAssessment"></div><div class="field"><label>Score %</label><input class="input" id="mScoreValue" type="number" min="0" max="100"></div></div>`}else if(type==='report'){title='Create Student Report';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Learner</label><input class="input" id="mReportLearner"></div><div class="field"><label>Term</label><input class="input" id="mReportTerm" value="Term 3"></div><div class="field full"><label>Teacher</label><input class="input" id="mReportTeacher"></div></div>`}else if(type==='officer'){title='Add Security Officer';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Name</label><input class="input" id="mOfficerName"></div><div class="field"><label>Employee ID</label><input class="input" id="mOfficerId"></div><div class="field"><label>Shift</label><select class="select" id="mOfficerShift"><option>Morning</option><option>Afternoon</option><option>Night</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Assigned site</label><input class="input" id="mOfficerSite"></div></div>`}else if(type==='assign'){title='Assign Guard, Shift, Site & Duties';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Supervisor</label><select class="select" id="mSup">${s.supervisors.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x.id)}">${esc(x.name)} — ${esc(x.id)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Guard</label><select class="select" id="mGuard">${s.securityOfficers.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x.id)}">${esc(x.name)} — ${esc(x.id)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Site</label><input class="input" id="mAssignSite"></div><div class="field"><label>Shift</label><select class="select" id="mAssignShift"><option>Morning</option><option>Afternoon</option><option>Night</option></select></div><div class="field full"><label>Duties</label><textarea class="textarea" id="mDuties" rows=3 placeholder="Gate coverage, patrols, checkpoint check-ins"></textarea></div></div>`}else if(type==='checkpoint-scan'){title='Guard Checkpoint Check-in';saveText='Check in';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Guard</label><select class="select" id="mScanGuard">${s.securityOfficers.map(o=>`<option value="${esc(o.id)}">${esc(o.name)} — ${esc(o.id)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Checkpoint QR</label><select class="select" id="mScanCp">${s.checkpoints.map(c=>`<option value="${esc(c.id)}">${esc(c.name)} — ${esc(c.qr)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Location verification</label><select class="select" id="mGeo"><option>In range — verified</option><option>Outside allowed radius — blocked</option></select></div></div>`}else if(type==='checkpoint'){title='Create Named QR Checkpoint';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Checkpoint name</label><input class="input" id="mCpName" placeholder="Main Gate"></div><div class="field"><label>Site</label><input class="input" id="mCpSite" value="Main Campus"></div><div class="field"><label>Latitude</label><input class="input" id="mCpLat"></div><div class="field"><label>Longitude</label><input class="input" id="mCpLng"></div><div class="field"><label>Allowed radius</label><input class="input" id="mCpRadius" value="100m"></div></div>`}else if(type==='parent'){title='Add Parent / Guardian';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Parent name</label><input class="input" id="mParName"></div><div class="field"><label>Learner</label><input class="input" id="mParLearner"></div><div class="field"><label>Phone</label><input class="input" id="mParPhone"></div><div class="field"><label>Email</label><input class="input" id="mParEmail" type="email"></div></div>`}else if(type==='staff'){title='Add Staff';body=`<div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>Name</label><input class="input" id="mStaffName"></div><div class="field"><label>Role</label><input class="input" id="mStaffRole"></div><div class="field"><label>Department</label><input class="input" id="mStaffDept"></div></div>`}else if(type==='pdf'){title='Student Record PDF';saveText='Close';body=`<div class="empty"><b>Student record ready</b><p>This prototype represents the PDF record access flow. A production version would retrieve the protected PDF from the backend.</p></div>`}else{return}
 $('#app').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',modal(title,body,`<button class="btn" data-close>Cancel</button><button class="btn primary" id="modalSave">${saveText}</button>`));$('#modalSave').onclick=()=>saveModal(type);$$('[data-close]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=closeModal)}
function saveModal(type){const s=state();const now=new Date();const time=now.toLocaleTimeString([], {hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'});if(type==='register')s.visitors.unshift({id:'VIS-'+String(1043+s.visitors.length),name:$('#mName').value||'New Visitor',host:$('#mHost').value||'Admin Office',purpose:$('#mPurpose').value||'General visit',in:time,out:'—',status:'Inside',type:$('#mType').value});else if(type==='incident'){s.incidents.unshift({id:'INC-2026-'+String(19+s.incidents.length).padStart(3,'0'),date:'10 Sep 2026',time,category:$('#mCat').value,location:$('#mLocation').value||'School campus',priority:$('#mPriority').value,status:'Open',officer:roleName(),learner:$('#mLearner').value||'—',description:$('#mDesc').value||'Incident reported.'});s.notifications.unshift({id:'NTF-'+String(8842+s.notifications.length),date:'10 Sep 2026',time,category:'Incident',priority:$('#mPriority').value,title:'Incident reported',description:$('#mDesc').value||'Incident reported.',by:roleName(),read:false,pinned:false})}else if(type==='emergency')s.notifications.unshift({id:'NTF-'+String(8842+s.notifications.length),date:'10 Sep 2026',time,category:'Emergency',priority:'Critical',title:$('#mAlertTitle').value||'Emergency alert',description:$('#mAlertDesc').value||'Emergency assistance required.',by:roleName(),read:false,pinned:true});else if(type==='scan'){const v=s.visitors.find(x=>x.id.toLowerCase()==($('#scanId').value||'').toLowerCase());if(v){v.status='Checked Out';v.out=time}else{alert('Visitor pass not found.')}}else if(type==='learner')s.learners.unshift({id:nextId('STU-',s.learners),name:$('#mLearnerName').value||'New Learner',grade:$('#mGrade').value||'Grade 1',class:$('#mClass').value||'1A',parent:$('#mParent').value||'Not linked',teacher:$('#mTeacher').value||'Unassigned',status:'Active'});else if(type==='sick'){s.sickNotices.unshift({id:nextId('SICK-',s.sickNotices),date:'10 Sep 2026',person:$('#mSickPerson').value||'Learner',submittedBy:$('#mSickBy').value||roleName(),reason:$('#mSickReason').value||'Sick notice submitted',status:'Received'});s.notifications.unshift({id:nextId('NTF-',s.notifications),date:'10 Sep 2026',time,category:'School',priority:'Medium',title:'Sick notice received',description:'A sick notice has been submitted.',by:roleName(),read:false,pinned:false})}else if(type==='announcement')s.announcements.unshift({id:nextId('ANN-',s.announcements),date:'10 Sep 2026',title:$('#mAnnTitle').value||'New announcement',audience:$('#mAnnAudience').value||'School',body:$('#mAnnBody').value||'',status:'Published'});else if(type==='appointment')s.appointments.unshift({id:nextId('APT-',s.appointments),date:$('#mApDate').value||'11 Sep 2026',time:$('#mApTime').value||'09:00',person:$('#mApPerson').value||'Visitor',purpose:$('#mApPurpose').value||'Appointment',staff:$('#mApStaff').value||roleName(),status:'Pending'});else if(type==='score')s.scores.unshift({id:nextId('SCORE-',s.scores),learner:$('#mScoreLearner').value||'Learner',subject:$('#mScoreSubject').value||'Subject',assessment:$('#mScoreAssessment').value||'Assessment',score:Number($('#mScoreValue').value||0),teacher:roleName()});else if(type==='report')s.reports.unshift({id:nextId('REP-',s.reports),learner:$('#mReportLearner').value||'Learner',term:$('#mReportTerm').value||'Term 3',teacher:$('#mReportTeacher').value||roleName(),status:'Draft',date:'10 Sep 2026'});else if(type==='officer')s.securityOfficers.unshift({id:$('#mOfficerId').value||nextId('SEC-',s.securityOfficers),name:$('#mOfficerName').value||'New Officer',badge:$('#mOfficerId').value||nextId('SEC-',s.securityOfficers),shift:$('#mOfficerShift').value,site:$('#mOfficerSite').value||'Unassigned',status:'On duty'});else if(type==='checkpoint')s.checkpoints.unshift({id:nextId('CP-',s.checkpoints),name:$('#mCpName').value||'New Checkpoint',site:$('#mCpSite').value||'Main Campus',lat:$('#mCpLat').value||'0',lng:$('#mCpLng').value||'0',radius:$('#mCpRadius').value||'100m',qr:'QR-'+Date.now(),status:'Active'});else if(type==='parent')s.parents.unshift({id:nextId('PAR-',s.parents),name:$('#mParName').value||'New Parent',learner:$('#mParLearner').value||'Not linked',phone:$('#mParPhone').value||'',email:$('#mParEmail').value||'',status:'Registered'});else if(type==='staff')s.staff.unshift({id:nextId('EMP-',s.staff),name:$('#mStaffName').value||'New Staff',role:$('#mStaffRole').value||'Staff',department:$('#mStaffDept').value||'General',status:'Active'});save(s);closeModal();render()}
function visitorDetails(id){const v=state().visitors.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!v)return;$('#app').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',modal('Visitor details',`<div class="form-grid"><div><small class="muted">Visitor</small><p><b>${esc(v.name)}</b></p></div><div><small class="muted">Visitor ID</small><p><b>${esc(v.id)}</b></p></div><div><small class="muted">Person visiting</small><p>${esc(v.host)}</p></div><div><small class="muted">Purpose</small><p>${esc(v.purpose)}</p></div><div><small class="muted">Check-in</small><p>${esc(v.in)}</p></div><div><small class="muted">Status</small><p>${badge(v.status)}</p></div></div>`,`<button class="btn" data-close>Close</button>`));$$('[data-close]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=closeModal)}
function closeModal(){$('#modal')?.remove()}
function sendChat(){const s=state();s.chats.push({id:nextId('CHAT-',s.chats),from:roleName(),to:currentRole()==='teacher'?'Registered Parent':'Teacher',message:$('#chatMessage').value||'Hello',time:'10 Sep 2026 '+new Date().toLocaleTimeString([], {hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'})});save(s);render()}
function sendReport(id){const s=state(),r=s.reports.find(x=>x.id===id);if(r){r.status='Sent to parent';save(s);render()}}
function deleteStaff(id){if(!['principal','deputy'].includes(currentRole()))return;const s=state();const u=s.staff.find(x=>x.id===id);if(u&&confirm(`Delete ${u.name} from SchoolShield?`)){s.staff=s.staff.filter(x=>x.id!==id);save(s);render()}}
function exportCsv(){const s=state();const rows=[['Type','ID','Date','Status']];s.incidents.forEach(x=>rows.push(['Incident',x.id,x.date,x.status]));s.visitors.forEach(x=>rows.push(['Visitor',x.id,x.in,x.status]));const csv=rows.map(r=>r.map(x=>`"${String(x).replaceAll('"','""')}"`).join(',')).join('\n');const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([csv],{type:'text/csv'}));a.download='schoolshield-report.csv';a.click()}
render();
